{"page":325,"verses":[{"verse_key":"21:36","surah":21,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا رَءَاكَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ إِن يَتَّخِذُونَكَ إِلَّا هُزُوًا أَهَـٰذَا ٱلَّذِى يَذْكُرُ ءَالِهَتَكُمْ وَهُم بِذِكْرِ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ هُمْ كَـٰفِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When the disbelievers see you, they laugh at you: ‘Is this the one who talks about your gods?’ They reject any talk of the Lord of Mercy.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَءَاكَ","en_gloss":"they see you","transliteration":"raāka","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَتَّخِذُونَكَ","en_gloss":"they take you","transliteration":"yattakhidhūnaka","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هُزُوًا","en_gloss":"(in) ridicule","transliteration":"huzuwan","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَهَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"Is this","transliteration":"ahādhā","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the one who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَذْكُرُ","en_gloss":"mentions","transliteration":"yadhkuru","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ءَالِهَتَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your gods","transliteration":"ālihatakum","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَهُم","en_gloss":"And they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِذِكْرِ","en_gloss":"at (the) mention","transliteration":"bidhik'ri","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Most Gracious","transliteration":"l-raḥmāni","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":16,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"[they]","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":17,"ar":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) disbelievers","transliteration":"kāfirūna","verse_key":"21:36"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٣٦","en_gloss":"(36)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:36"}]},{"verse_key":"21:37","surah":21,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"خُلِقَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مِنْ عَجَلٍ ۚ سَأُو۟رِيكُمْ ءَايَـٰتِى فَلَا تَسْتَعْجِلُونِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Man was created hasty: I will show you My signs soon, so do not ask Me to hasten them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"خُلِقَ","en_gloss":"Is created","transliteration":"khuliqa","verse_key":"21:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the man","transliteration":"l-insānu","verse_key":"21:37"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:37"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَجَلٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"haste","transliteration":"ʿajalin","verse_key":"21:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"سَأُو۟رِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"I will show you","transliteration":"sa-urīkum","verse_key":"21:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِى","en_gloss":"My Signs","transliteration":"āyātī","verse_key":"21:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"so (do) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"21:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَسْتَعْجِلُونِ","en_gloss":"ask Me to hasten","transliteration":"tastaʿjilūni","verse_key":"21:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٣٧","en_gloss":"(37)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:37"}]},{"verse_key":"21:38","surah":21,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُونَ مَتَىٰ هَـٰذَا ٱلْوَعْدُ إِن كُنتُمْ صَـٰدِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They say, ‘When will this promise be fulfilled, if what you say is true?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"And they say","transliteration":"wayaqūlūna","verse_key":"21:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَتَىٰ","en_gloss":"When (will be fulfilled)","transliteration":"matā","verse_key":"21:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"21:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْوَعْدُ","en_gloss":"promise","transliteration":"l-waʿdu","verse_key":"21:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"21:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you are","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"21:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","en_gloss":"truthful","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","verse_key":"21:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٣٨","en_gloss":"(38)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:38"}]},{"verse_key":"21:39","surah":21,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"لَوْ يَعْلَمُ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ حِينَ لَا يَكُفُّونَ عَن وُجُوهِهِمُ ٱلنَّارَ وَلَا عَن ظُهُورِهِمْ وَلَا هُمْ يُنصَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If the disbelievers only knew, the time will arrive when they will not be able to ward off the Fire from their faces or their backs, and they will get no help.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knew","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حِينَ","en_gloss":"(the) time","transliteration":"ḥīna","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(when) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَكُفُّونَ","en_gloss":"they will avert","transliteration":"yakuffūna","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وُجُوهِهِمُ","en_gloss":"their faces","transliteration":"wujūhihimu","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلنَّارَ","en_gloss":"the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāra","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ظُهُورِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their backs","transliteration":"ẓuhūrihim","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":15,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يُنصَرُونَ","en_gloss":"will be helped","transliteration":"yunṣarūna","verse_key":"21:39"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٣٩","en_gloss":"(39)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:39"}]},{"verse_key":"21:40","surah":21,"ayah":40,"ar_uthmani":"بَلْ تَأْتِيهِم بَغْتَةً فَتَبْهَتُهُمْ فَلَا يَسْتَطِيعُونَ رَدَّهَا وَلَا هُمْ يُنظَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It will come upon them suddenly and stupefy them; they will be powerless to push it away; they will not be reprieved.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"21:40"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَأْتِيهِم","en_gloss":"it will come to them","transliteration":"tatīhim","verse_key":"21:40"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَغْتَةًۭ","en_gloss":"unexpectedly","transliteration":"baghtatan","verse_key":"21:40"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَتَبْهَتُهُمْ","en_gloss":"and bewilder them","transliteration":"fatabhatuhum","verse_key":"21:40"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"21:40"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","en_gloss":"they will be able","transliteration":"yastaṭīʿūna","verse_key":"21:40"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَدَّهَا","en_gloss":"to repel it","transliteration":"raddahā","verse_key":"21:40"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"21:40"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"21:40"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُنظَرُونَ","en_gloss":"will be given respite","transliteration":"yunẓarūna","verse_key":"21:40"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٤٠","en_gloss":"(40)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:40"}]},{"verse_key":"21:41","surah":21,"ayah":41,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدِ ٱسْتُهْزِئَ بِرُسُلٍ مِّن قَبْلِكَ فَحَاقَ بِٱلَّذِينَ سَخِرُوا۟ مِنْهُم مَّا كَانُوا۟ بِهِۦ يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Messengers before you [Muhammad] were also ridiculed, but those who mocked them were overwhelmed in the end by the very thing they had mocked.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدِ","en_gloss":"And verily","transliteration":"walaqadi","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱسْتُهْزِئَ","en_gloss":"were mocked","transliteration":"us'tuh'zi-a","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِرُسُلٍۢ","en_gloss":"Messengers","transliteration":"birusulin","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَحَاقَ","en_gloss":"then surrounded","transliteration":"faḥāqa","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"bi-alladhīna","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سَخِرُوا۟","en_gloss":"mocked","transliteration":"sakhirū","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِنْهُم","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"at it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","en_gloss":"(to) mock","transliteration":"yastahziūna","verse_key":"21:41"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٤١","en_gloss":"(41)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:41"}]},{"verse_key":"21:42","surah":21,"ayah":42,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ مَن يَكْلَؤُكُم بِٱلَّيْلِ وَٱلنَّهَارِ مِنَ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ ۗ بَلْ هُمْ عَن ذِكْرِ رَبِّهِم مُّعْرِضُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘Who could protect you night and day from the Lord of Mercy?’ Yet they turn away when their Lord is mentioned.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"21:42"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"Who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"21:42"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَكْلَؤُكُم","en_gloss":"(can) protect you","transliteration":"yakla-ukum","verse_key":"21:42"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلَّيْلِ","en_gloss"